OL,3,GNEWSABells could be removed from listed
OL,4,Achurch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA set of eight bells could be
OL,7,Fpermanently removed from a Grade II
OL,8,Flisted church after it closed as a
OL,9,Fplace of worship.
OL,11,FPlans have been submitted by the Durham
OL,12,FDiocese Board of Finance to remove the
OL,13,Fbells from St Mary's Church in South
OL,14,FHylton, Sunderland, so they can be
OL,15,Frepaired and potentially reused
OL,16,Felsewhere.
OL,18,FThe church has entered a "use seeking
OL,19,Fperiod" following a declining
OL,20,Fcongregation and rising repair costs,
OL,21,Faccording to a heritage statement
OL,22,Fsubmitted with the application.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
